{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 7,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 144.786,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, for thus saith the Lord:",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.084,
      "end": 3.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Have I put thee away,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 3.982,
      "end": 6.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or have I cast thee off forever?",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 6.438,
      "end": 8.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For thus saith the Lord:",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 8.29,
      "end": 11.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Where is the bill of your mother's divorcement?",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 11.349,
      "end": 13.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "To whom have I put thee away,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 13.572,
      "end": 16.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to which of my creditors have I sold you?",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 16.353,
      "end": 18.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, to whom have I sold you?",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 18.298,
      "end": 21.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, for your iniquities have ye sold yourselves,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 21.868,
      "end": 25.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for your transgressions is your mother put away.",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 25.938,
      "end": 28.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, when I came, there was no man;",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 28.719,
      "end": 31.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when I called, yea, there was none to answer.",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 31.593,
      "end": 33.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O house of Israel,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 33.259,
      "end": 36.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is my hand shortened at all that it cannot redeem,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 36.69,
      "end": 38.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or have I no power to deliver?",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 38.867,
      "end": 41.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, at my rebuke I dry up the sea,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 41.973,
      "end": 44.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I make their rivers a wilderness",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 44.754,
      "end": 47.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their fish to stink because the waters are dried up,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 48.045,
      "end": 50.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they die because of thirst.",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 51.186,
      "end": 53.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I clothe the heavens with blackness,",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 53.688,
      "end": 56.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I make sackcloth their covering.",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 56.69,
      "end": 63.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Lord God hath given me the tongue of the learned, that I should know how to speak a word in season unto thee,",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 63.511,
      "end": 65.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O house of Israel.",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 65.224,
      "end": 68.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "When ye are weary he waketh morning by morning.",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 68.283,
      "end": 70.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "He waketh mine ear to hear as the learned.",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 71.564,
      "end": 73.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Lord God hath opened mine ear,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 73.927,
      "end": 75.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I was not rebellious,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 75.779,
      "end": 77.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither turned away back.",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 77.945,
      "end": 80.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I gave my back to the smiter,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 80.261,
      "end": 83.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my cheeks to them that plucked off the hair.",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 83.831,
      "end": 86.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I hid not my face from shame and spitting.",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 86.879,
      "end": 88.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the Lord God will help me,",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 89.102,
      "end": 91.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore shall I not be confounded.",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 91.511,
      "end": 93.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore have I set my face like a flint,",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 94.152,
      "end": 96.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I know that I shall not be ashamed.",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 97.061,
      "end": 99.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord is near, and he justifieth me.",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 99.842,
      "end": 101.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Who will contend with me?",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 101.508,
      "end": 103.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Let us stand together.",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 103.453,
      "end": 105.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Who is mine adversary?",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 105.258,
      "end": 109.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Let him come near me, and I will smite him with the strength of my mouth.",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 110.35,
      "end": 112.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the Lord God will help me.",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 112.341,
      "end": 114.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all they who shall condemn me,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 114.704,
      "end": 117.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, all they shall wax old as a garment,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 117.949,
      "end": 119.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the moth shall eat them up.",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 120.579,
      "end": 123.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Who is among you that feareth the Lord,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 123.267,
      "end": 125.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that obeyeth the voice of his servant,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 126.094,
      "end": 128.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that walketh in darkness and hath no light?",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 129.468,
      "end": 131.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold all ye that kindle fire,",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 131.877,
      "end": 134.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that compass yourselves about with sparks,",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 134.936,
      "end": 137.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "walk in the light of your fire",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 137.206,
      "end": 139.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the sparks which ye have kindled.",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 139.847,
      "end": 142.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "This shall ye have of mine hand\u2014",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 142.256,
      "end": 144.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall lie down in sorrow.",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    }
  ]
}